        "id": 1060831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-04T14:04:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree that it blocks loading shared libraries, and that that is a good thing.\n\nThis is for config APKs. Code being run inside the VM should be part of the VM identity.",
      "parentUuid": "f67691f2_bf1f33fe",
      "revId": "cc339a1978ee108ae5d11b60682a6458d05e6059",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "33bae6eb_b300f547",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
